ERD Concept


🧍‍♂️ 1. users

id (PK)

name

email (unique)

password

created_at

updated_at

🔗 Relations:

hasMany colocations (as owner)

belongsToMany colocations (via colocation_user)

hasMany expenses

hasMany payments

hasMany sent invitations

hasMany received invitations

🏠 2. colocations

id (PK)

name

owner_id (FK → users.id)

created_at

updated_at

🔗 Relations:

belongsTo owner (User)

belongsToMany users (via colocation_user)

hasMany expenses

hasMany categories

hasMany invitations

🔁 3. colocation_user (Pivot)

id (optional)

colocation_id (FK)

user_id (FK)

joined_at

📌 Role:
تمثل الأعضاء داخل السكن.

Relation:
Many-to-Many بين users و colocations

✉️ 4. invitations (Internal Only)

id

colocation_id (FK)

sender_id (FK → users.id)

receiver_id (FK → users.id)

status ENUM('pending','accepted','refused')

created_at

updated_at

📌 Role:
دعوة داخل التطبيق فقط

📂 5. categories

id

colocation_id (FK)

name

created_at

updated_at

📌 مثال:

Loyer

Électricité

Internet

Nourriture

💸 6. expenses

id

colocation_id (FK)

category_id (FK)

paid_by (FK → users.id)

title

amount (decimal)

expense_date

created_at

updated_at

📌 تمثل المصاريف المدفوعة من طرف عضو

💳 7. payments

id

colocation_id (FK)

payer_id (FK → users.id)

receiver_id (FK → users.id)

amount

payment_date

created_at

updated_at

📌 تمثل تسديد دين بين عضوين

🔷 Final ERD Relations (Concept)
User
 ├── owns → Colocation
 ├── belongsToMany → Colocation
 ├── pays → Expense
 ├── sends → Invitation
 ├── receives → Invitation
 └── makes → Payment

Colocation
 ├── hasMany → Expense
 ├── hasMany → Category
 ├── hasMany → Invitation
 └── belongsToMany → User

Expense
 ├── belongsTo → User (paid_by)
 ├── belongsTo → Colocation
 └── belongsTo → Category

Payment
 ├── payer → User
 ├── receiver → User
 └── belongsTo → Colocation